From: Yancey <135342560+Yancey2023@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Feb 2026 08:10:25 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Fix deprecated copy constructor usage of
 fmt::format_string (#3541)

* Fix deprecated copy constructor usage of fmt::format_string

* Fix copy constructor usage of fmt::wformat_string_t

* Fix usage of std::basic_format_string

* remove spdlog::to_string_view()

(cherry picked from commit 1685e694c5cd8328280c48f8b94b1281c17c6fee)
---
 include/spdlog/common.h          | 32 ----------------
 include/spdlog/logger.h          | 64 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 include/spdlog/spdlog.h          | 64 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 tests/test_fmt_helper.cpp        |  6 ++-
 tests/test_pattern_formatter.cpp |  6 ++-
 5 files changed, 136 insertions(+), 36 deletions(-)

